{"id":"a1.u06","level":"A1","order":6,"title":{"en":"Food","ru":"Еда"},"description":"Говорим о еде и напитках: что мы любим, что хотим и чего у нас нет. Вопросы в Present Simple, some и any, like и want, заказ в кафе.","goals":["Могу назвать продукты, напитки и блюда.","Могу сказать, что люблю и что не люблю: I like soup. I don't like onions.","Могу задать вопрос: Do you like tea? Does she eat meat? — и коротко ответить.","Могу сказать some и any: I have some bread. I don't have any milk.","Могу сделать заказ в кафе: Can I have a coffee, please?","Могу написать короткий текст о своей еде."],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions","a1.some-any","a1.like-want"],"troubles":["tenses","articles"],"texts":[{"id":"a1.u06.cafe","kind":"dialogue","genre":"conversation","title":{"en":"In the restaurant","ru":"В ресторане"},"speakers":[{"id":"tom","name":"Tom","voice":"male"},{"id":"kate","name":"Kate","voice":"female"}],"lines":[{"speaker":"tom","en":"Good morning! Here is the menu.","ru":"Доброе утро! Вот меню."},{"speaker":"kate","en":"Thank you. Can I have a coffee, please?","ru":"Спасибо. Можно мне кофе, пожалуйста?"},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Yes. Do you want some food?","ru":"Да. Вы хотите что-нибудь поесть?"},{"speaker":"kate","en":"Yes, I want a sandwich with cheese.","ru":"Да, я хочу бутерброд с сыром."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Do you like tomatoes?","ru":"Вы любите помидоры?"},{"speaker":"kate","en":"Yes, I do. But I don't like onions.","ru":"Да. Но я не люблю лук."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"OK. A coffee and a cheese sandwich with tomato.","ru":"Хорошо. Кофе и бутерброд с сыром и помидором."}],"glossary":[]},{"id":"a1.u06.elena-food","kind":"reading","genre":"article","title":{"en":"Elena and Ivan","ru":"Елена и Иван"},"speakers":[],"lines":[{"en":"Elena likes fruit and vegetables. In the morning she has bread with butter and drinks tea.","ru":"Елена любит фрукты и овощи. Утром она ест хлеб с маслом и пьёт чай."},{"en":"For lunch she eats soup and salad. She doesn't eat meat, but she likes fish and cheese.","ru":"На обед она ест суп и салат. Она не ест мясо, но любит рыбу и сыр."},{"en":"Her brother Ivan doesn't like vegetables. He likes pizza, chicken and rice. He drinks coffee with sugar.","ru":"Её брат Иван не любит овощи. Он любит пиццу, курицу и рис. Он пьёт кофе с сахаром."},{"en":"In the evening they are hungry. They cook dinner and eat at home.","ru":"Вечером они голодны. Они готовят ужин и едят дома."}],"glossary":[]}],"lessons":[{"id":"a1.u06.l01","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Продукты и блюда","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e01","hint":"Butter читается как «баттер».","explanation":"Bread — хлеб, butter — масло, rice — рис, meat — мясо, chicken — курица.","difficulty":1,"words":["bread","butter","rice","meat","chicken"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"bread","ru":"хлеб"},{"en":"butter","ru":"масло"},{"en":"rice","ru":"рис"},{"en":"meat","ru":"мясо"},{"en":"chicken","ru":"курица"}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e02","hint":"Часть слов похожа на русские.","explanation":"Soup — суп, salad — салат, sandwich — бутерброд, pizza — пицца, food — еда.","difficulty":1,"words":["food","soup","salad","sandwich","pizza"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"soup","ru":"суп"},{"en":"salad","ru":"салат"},{"en":"sandwich","ru":"бутерброд"},{"en":"pizza","ru":"пицца"},{"en":"food","ru":"еда"}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e03","hint":"Все они растут на грядке.","explanation":"Potato — картошка, tomato — помидор, carrot — морковь, onion — лук, vegetable — овощ.","difficulty":1,"words":["potato","tomato","carrot","onion","vegetable"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"potato","ru":"картошка"},{"en":"tomato","ru":"помидор"},{"en":"carrot","ru":"морковь"},{"en":"onion","ru":"лук"},{"en":"vegetable","ru":"овощ"}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e04","hint":"Его пекут в духовке.","explanation":"Bread — «хлеб»: [bred].","difficulty":1,"words":["bread"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"bread","distractors":["cheese","egg"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e05","hint":"Его едят ложкой.","explanation":"Soup — «суп»: [suːp].","difficulty":1,"words":["soup"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"soup","distractors":["salad","rice"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e06","hint":"Красный овощ.","explanation":"Tomato — «помидор»: [təˈmeɪtoʊ].","difficulty":1,"words":["tomato"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"word-to-picture","word":"tomato","distractors":["carrot","onion"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e07","hint":"Круглое блюдо из Италии.","explanation":"Pizza — «пицца»: [ˈpiːtsə].","difficulty":1,"words":["pizza"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"word-to-picture","word":"pizza","distractors":["sandwich","salad"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e08","hint":"Слово звучит так же, как слово «встречать».","explanation":"Meat [miːt] — «мясо». Meet [miːt] — «встречать»: произносятся одинаково.","difficulty":1,"words":["meat"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"мясо","options":["meat","meet","milk"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e09","hint":"Её добавляют в суп.","explanation":"Salt — «соль». Sugar — «сахар», butter — «масло».","difficulty":1,"words":["salt"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"salt","options":["соль","сахар","масло"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e10","hint":"Это блюдо из мяса птицы.","explanation":"Chicken [ˈtʃɪkɪn] — «курица». Kitchen [ˈkɪtʃɪn] — «кухня»: звуки в другом порядке.","difficulty":1,"words":["chicken"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"chicken","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["chicken","kitchen","cheese"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e11","hint":"Три слова.","explanation":"I like tomatoes — «я люблю помидоры».","difficulty":1,"words":["tomato","like"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"I like tomatoes.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e12","hint":"Четыре буквы.","explanation":"Soup [suːp] — «суп».","difficulty":1,"words":["soup"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"суп","answers":["soup"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e13","hint":"Шесть букв, заканчивается на o.","explanation":"Potato [pəˈteɪtoʊ] — «картошка». Во множественном числе — potatoes.","difficulty":1,"words":["potato"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"картошка","answers":["potato"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e14","hint":"Ударный слог — в середине.","explanation":"po-TA-to — ударение на второй слог.","difficulty":1,"words":["potato"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"word_stress","word":"potato","syllables":["po","ta","to"],"stress":1},{"id":"a1.u06.l01.e15","hint":"Ударение на первом слоге.","explanation":"VEG-e-ta-ble — ударение на первый слог. Слово произносится почти как три слога.","difficulty":1,"words":["vegetable"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"word_stress","word":"vegetable","syllables":["veg","e","ta","ble"],"stress":0}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Напитки, вкус и глаголы","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e01","hint":"Первые три слова — напитки.","explanation":"Coffee — кофе, tea — чай, juice — сок, sugar — сахар, fruit — фрукты.","difficulty":1,"words":["sugar","coffee","tea","juice","fruit"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"coffee","ru":"кофе"},{"en":"tea","ru":"чай"},{"en":"juice","ru":"сок"},{"en":"sugar","ru":"сахар"},{"en":"fruit","ru":"фрукты"}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e02","hint":"Hungry — про еду, thirsty — про питьё.","explanation":"Hungry — голодный, thirsty — хочет пить, cold — холодный, sweet — сладкий, tasty — вкусный.","difficulty":1,"words":["hungry","thirsty","cold","sweet","tasty"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"hungry","ru":"голодный"},{"en":"thirsty","ru":"хотящий пить"},{"en":"cold","ru":"холодный"},{"en":"sweet","ru":"сладкий"},{"en":"tasty","ru":"вкусный"}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e03","hint":"Cook вы уже знаете из прошлого юнита.","explanation":"Eat — есть, drink — пить, like — любить, want — хотеть, cook — готовить.","difficulty":1,"words":["eat","drink","like","want"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"eat","ru":"есть"},{"en":"drink","ru":"пить"},{"en":"like","ru":"любить"},{"en":"want","ru":"хотеть"},{"en":"cook","ru":"готовить"}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e04","hint":"Бодрящий напиток.","explanation":"Coffee — «кофе»: [ˈkɔːfi].","difficulty":1,"words":["coffee"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"coffee","distractors":["tea","juice"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e05","hint":"Напиток из фруктов.","explanation":"Juice — «сок»: [dʒuːs].","difficulty":1,"words":["juice"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"word-to-picture","word":"juice","distractors":["tea","coffee"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e06","hint":"Хочется воды.","explanation":"I am thirsty — «я хочу пить». I am hungry — «я голоден».","difficulty":1,"words":["hungry","thirsty","cold"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"Я хочу пить.","options":["I am thirsty.","I am hungry.","I am cold."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e07","hint":"Хочется поесть.","explanation":"I am hungry — «я голоден». Про состояние говорят с be: I am…","difficulty":1,"words":["hungry"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"I am hungry.","options":["Я голоден.","Я хочу пить.","Мне холодно."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e08","hint":"Кофе нельзя съесть.","explanation":"I drink coffee in the morning. Пить — drink.","difficulty":1,"words":["coffee","eat","drink"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ coffee in the morning.","translation":"Я пью кофе по утрам.","answers":[["drink"]],"options":["drink","eat","cook"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e09","hint":"Суп едят ложкой.","explanation":"We eat soup for lunch. Возможен и вариант have: We have soup.","difficulty":1,"words":["soup","eat","drink","want","for"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"We ___ soup for lunch.","translation":"На обед мы едим суп.","answers":[["eat","have"]],"options":["eat","drink","want"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e10","hint":"Сахара в нём много.","explanation":"The cake is sweet. Tasty тоже подходит — «вкусный».","difficulty":1,"words":["hungry","cold","sweet","tasty"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"The cake is ___.","translation":"Торт сладкий.","answers":[["sweet","tasty"]],"options":["sweet","cold","hungry"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e11","hint":"Первый звук в слове — как в слове thanks.","explanation":"I am thirsty — «я хочу пить». Th в начале читается межзубным звуком [θ].","difficulty":1,"words":["hungry","thirsty"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-th"],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"I am thirsty.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["I am thirsty.","I am hungry.","I am happy."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e12","hint":"Пять слов.","explanation":"I drink tea with sugar — «я пью чай с сахаром».","difficulty":1,"words":["sugar","tea","drink","with"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"I drink tea with sugar.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e13","hint":"Пять букв.","explanation":"Tasty [ˈteɪsti] — «вкусный».","difficulty":1,"words":["tasty"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"вкусный","answers":["tasty"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e14","hint":"С лимоном — with lemon.","explanation":"I like tea with lemon. With — «с»: [wɪð].","difficulty":1,"words":["tea","like","with","for"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Я люблю чай с лимоном.","answer":"I like tea with lemon.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["am","for"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e15","hint":"Здесь слышен долгий гласный.","explanation":"Eat [iːt] — долгий гласный, it [ɪt] — короткий.","difficulty":1,"words":["eat"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"minimal_pair","pair":[{"en":"eat","ipa":"iːt"},{"en":"it","ipa":"ɪt"}],"say":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l02.e16","hint":"Две части, между ними пауза.","explanation":"Hungry [ˈhʌŋɡri]: ударение на первый слог. Скажите обе части слитно.","difficulty":1,"words":["soup","hungry","want"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"I am hungry and I want some soup."}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03","kind":"grammar","title":"Some и any, считаемые и несчитаемые слова","grammar":"a1.some-any","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e01","hint":"Утверждение, и слово нельзя посчитать.","explanation":"I have some bread. В утверждении перед несчитаемым словом — some.","difficulty":1,"words":["bread"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I have ___ bread.","translation":"У меня есть хлеб.","answers":[["some"]],"options":["some","any","a"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e02","hint":"Утверждение, много штук.","explanation":"We have some tomatoes. В утверждении перед множественным числом — some.","difficulty":1,"words":["tomato"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"We have ___ tomatoes.","translation":"У нас есть помидоры.","answers":[["some"]],"options":["some","any","an"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e03","hint":"В отрицании — другое слово.","explanation":"I don't have any milk. В отрицании ставят any.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":["articles"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I don't have ___ milk.","translation":"У меня нет молока.","answers":[["any"]],"options":["any","some","a"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e04","hint":"Вопрос о количестве.","explanation":"Do you want any sugar? В вопросе обычно any. Some тоже можно, когда предлагают.","difficulty":1,"words":["sugar","want"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Do you want ___ sugar?","translation":"Вы хотите сахар?","answers":[["any","some"]],"options":["any","an","a"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e05","hint":"Предложение отрицательное.","explanation":"There isn't any soup. В отрицании — any.","difficulty":1,"words":["soup"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"There isn't ___ soup.","translation":"Супа нет.","answers":[["any"]],"options":["any","some","a"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e06","hint":"Одно яблоко. Слово начинается с гласной.","explanation":"I want an apple. Одно считаемое слово — a или an. Перед гласной — an.","difficulty":1,"words":["want"],"grammar":["a1.some-any","a1.articles-a-an"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I want ___ apple.","translation":"Я хочу яблоко.","answers":[["an"]],"options":["an","some","any"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e07","hint":"Хлеб нельзя посчитать.","explanation":"I have some bread. Перед несчитаемым словом a не ставят.","difficulty":1,"words":["bread"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":["articles"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I have a bread.","wrong":"a bread","correction":"some bread","options":["some bread","an bread","any bread"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e08","hint":"В отрицании — другое слово.","explanation":"I don't have any milk. В отрицании — any.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":["articles"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I don't have some milk.","wrong":"some","correction":"any","options":["any","a","an"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e09","hint":"Рис нельзя посчитать.","explanation":"I eat some rice. Rice — несчитаемое слово.","difficulty":1,"words":["rice","eat"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":["articles"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I eat a rice.","wrong":"a rice","correction":"some rice","options":["some rice","an rice","any rice"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e10","hint":"В отрицании — any.","explanation":"We don't have any sugar. После don't глагол have без изменений.","difficulty":1,"words":["sugar"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"У нас нет сахара.","answer":"We don't have any sugar.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["some","doesn't"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e11","hint":"Утверждение.","explanation":"I have some rice. В утверждении — some.","difficulty":1,"words":["rice"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"У меня есть немного риса.","answer":"I have some rice.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["any","a"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e12","hint":"Начните с Is there.","explanation":"Is there any milk? Вопрос с there is — как в юните про дом. Здесь добавляется any.","difficulty":2,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.some-any","a1.there-is"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Есть ли молоко?","answers":["Is there any milk?"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e13","hint":"Образец: Don't + eat.","explanation":"I don't eat meat. Перед несчитаемым meat артикль не нужен.","difficulty":2,"words":["meat","eat"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Я не ем мясо.","answers":["I don't eat meat.","I do not eat meat."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e14","hint":"Говорят о нескольких людях и отрицают.","explanation":"We don't have any bread — «у нас нет хлеба».","difficulty":1,"words":["bread"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"We don't have any bread.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["We don't have any bread.","We have some bread.","I don't have any bread."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l03.e15","hint":"Четыре слова.","explanation":"I have some food — «у меня есть еда».","difficulty":1,"words":["food"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"I have some food.","answers":[]}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04","kind":"grammar","title":"Вопросы: Do you…? Does she…?","grammar":"a1.present-simple-questions","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e01","hint":"Вопрос про вас.","explanation":"Do you like tea? С you — do.","difficulty":1,"words":["tea","like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"___ you like tea?","translation":"Вы любите чай?","answers":[["Do"]],"options":["Do","Does","Are"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e02","hint":"Речь о другой женщине.","explanation":"Does she eat meat? С she — does.","difficulty":1,"words":["meat","eat"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"___ she eat meat?","translation":"Она ест мясо?","answers":[["Does"]],"options":["Does","Do","Is"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e03","hint":"Окончание уже есть в does.","explanation":"Does he like fish? После does глагол без -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Does he ___ fish?","translation":"Он любит рыбу?","answers":[["like"]],"options":["like","likes","liking"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e04","hint":"Глагол не меняется.","explanation":"Do they want pizza? После do глагол без -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["pizza","want"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Do they ___ pizza?","translation":"Они хотят пиццу?","answers":[["want"]],"options":["want","wants","wanting"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e05","hint":"Короткий ответ повторяет первое слово вопроса.","explanation":"Yes, I do. Короткий ответ повторяет do, а глагол не повторяют.","difficulty":1,"words":["soup","like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Do you like soup? — Yes, I ___.","translation":"Вы любите суп? — Да.","answers":[["do"]],"options":["do","like","am"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e06","hint":"Ответ про she.","explanation":"No, she doesn't. С she — doesn't.","difficulty":1,"words":["eat"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Does she eat fish? — No, she ___.","translation":"Она ест рыбу? — Нет.","answers":[["doesn't","does not"]],"options":["doesn't","don't","isn't"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e07","hint":"Вопрос начинается со вспомогательного слова.","explanation":"Do you like tea? Для вопроса нужно do.","difficulty":1,"words":["tea","like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"You like tea?","wrong":"You like tea?","correction":"Do you like tea?","options":["Do you like tea?","Does you like tea?","Are you like tea?"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e08","hint":"-s уже есть в does.","explanation":"Does she like tea? После does глагол без -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["tea","like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"Does she likes tea?","wrong":"likes","correction":"like","options":["like","liking","is like"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e09","hint":"С he — другая форма.","explanation":"Does he eat bread? С he, she, it — does.","difficulty":1,"words":["bread","eat"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"Do he eat bread?","wrong":"Do","correction":"Does","options":["Does","Is","Are"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e10","hint":"Вежливое предложение — some.","explanation":"Do you want some coffee? Когда предлагают, говорят some.","difficulty":1,"words":["coffee","want"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions","a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Вы хотите кофе?","answer":"Do you want some coffee?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["Does","any"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e11","hint":"На завтрак — for breakfast.","explanation":"What do you eat for breakfast? Вопросительное слово — в начале, потом do you.","difficulty":2,"words":["eat","for"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Что вы едите на завтрак?","answer":"What do you eat for breakfast?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["does","at"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e12","hint":"Does + she + глагол.","explanation":"Does she like fruit? Fruit — без -s.","difficulty":2,"words":["fruit","like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Она любит фрукты?","answers":["Does she like fruit?"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e13","hint":"Where стоит в начале.","explanation":"Where do you have lunch? Обедать — have lunch.","difficulty":2,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Где вы обедаете?","answers":["Where do you have lunch?"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e14","hint":"Yes, I… или No, I…","explanation":"Короткий ответ: Yes, I do. или No, I don't.","difficulty":3,"words":["tea","like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"Do you like tea?","questionRu":"Вы любите чай? Ответьте коротко: Yes, I do. или No, I don't.","keywords":[["\\b(yes|no)\\b"],["\\bI (do|don't|do not)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["Yes, I do.","No, I don't."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l04.e15","hint":"Интонация вопроса идёт вверх.","explanation":"В вопросе без вопросительного слова интонация идёт вверх на конце.","difficulty":1,"words":["tomato","onion","like"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"Do you like tomatoes and onions?"}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05","kind":"grammar","title":"Like, want и заказ в кафе","grammar":"a1.like-want","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e01","hint":"О другой женщине.","explanation":"She likes soup. С she — like с -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["soup","like"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ soup.","translation":"Ей нравится суп.","answers":[["likes"]],"options":["likes","like","is like"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e02","hint":"После doesn't глагол без окончания.","explanation":"He doesn't like fish. После doesn't — без -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["like"],"grammar":["a1.like-want","a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He doesn't ___ fish.","translation":"Он не любит рыбу.","answers":[["like"]],"options":["like","likes","liking"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e03","hint":"Короткое слово перед глаголом.","explanation":"I want to eat. Между want и глаголом нужно to.","difficulty":1,"words":["eat","want","with","for"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I want ___ eat.","translation":"Я хочу есть.","answers":[["to"]],"options":["to","for","with"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e04","hint":"После like — форма на -ing.","explanation":"I like cooking. После like действие называют с -ing.","difficulty":1,"words":["like"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I like ___.","translation":"Мне нравится готовить.","answers":[["cooking"]],"options":["cooking","cooks","cooked"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e05","hint":"Такое же слово, как в I want…","explanation":"She wants to drink some water. С she — wants + to + глагол.","difficulty":1,"words":["drink","want","with","for"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She wants ___ drink some water.","translation":"Она хочет пить воду.","answers":[["to"]],"options":["to","for","with"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e06","hint":"Вежливая просьба в кафе.","explanation":"Can I have a coffee, please? Так просят в кафе.","difficulty":1,"words":["coffee","can-i-have"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"___ I have a coffee, please?","translation":"Можно мне кофе, пожалуйста?","answers":[["Can"]],"options":["Can","Do","Is"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e07","hint":"Like уже глагол.","explanation":"I like pizza. Like — глагол, be не нужен.","difficulty":1,"words":["pizza","like"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I am like pizza.","wrong":"am like","correction":"like","options":["like","likes","am liking"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e08","hint":"С she — окончание.","explanation":"She likes fruit. С she — likes.","difficulty":1,"words":["fruit","like"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"She like fruit.","wrong":"like","correction":"likes","options":["likes","liking","is like"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e09","hint":"Нужно короткое слово.","explanation":"I want to eat. Между want и глаголом нужно to.","difficulty":1,"words":["eat","want","for"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I want eat.","wrong":"want eat","correction":"want to eat","options":["want to eat","want for eat","want eating"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e10","hint":"Начните с Can.","explanation":"Can I have a tea, please? В кафе tea считается как «чашка чая».","difficulty":1,"words":["tea","can-i-have"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Можно мне чай, пожалуйста?","answer":"Can I have a tea, please?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["some","do"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e11","hint":"Нужно слово между want и глаголом.","explanation":"I want to eat. Want + to + глагол.","difficulty":1,"words":["eat","want","for"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Я хочу есть.","answer":"I want to eat.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["for","am"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e12","hint":"Три слова.","explanation":"I like pizza. Like — любить, нравиться.","difficulty":1,"words":["pizza","like"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Я люблю пиццу.","answers":["I like pizza."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e13","hint":"С she — doesn't.","explanation":"She doesn't like onions. После doesn't — like без -s.","difficulty":2,"words":["onion","like"],"grammar":["a1.like-want","a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Она не любит лук.","answers":["She doesn't like onions.","She does not like onions."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e14","hint":"I want some… или I want a…","explanation":"Отвечаем полным предложением: I want some soup.","difficulty":3,"words":["soup","pizza","want","for"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"What do you want for dinner?","questionRu":"Что вы хотите на ужин? Ответьте: I want some… или I want a…","keywords":[["\\bI want\\b"],["\\b(soup|salad|pizza|chicken|rice|fish|meat|bread|cheese|sandwich|potato|potatoes|vegetables|fruit)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["I want some soup.","I want a pizza."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l05.e15","hint":"Вежливый тон, интонация идёт вверх.","explanation":"Please — «пожалуйста»: делает просьбу вежливой.","difficulty":1,"words":["coffee","sandwich","can-i-have"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"Can I have a coffee and a sandwich, please?"}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l06","kind":"listening","title":"В ресторане","textId":"a1.u06.cafe","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e01","hint":"Слушайте, что заказывает Кейт.","explanation":"Кейт заказывает кофе и бутерброд с сыром. Лук она не любит.","difficulty":1,"words":["chicken","tomato","onion","coffee","tea","juice","like","with"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"comprehension","mode":"listening","textId":"a1.u06.cafe","questions":[{"kind":"mcq","question":"Что Кейт хочет выпить?","options":["a coffee","a tea","some juice"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Кейт говорит: Can I have a coffee, please?"},{"kind":"mcq","question":"Какой бутерброд она хочет?","options":["with cheese","with chicken","with fish"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Кейт говорит: I want a sandwich with cheese."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Kate likes tomatoes.","answer":"true","explanation":"На вопрос Do you like tomatoes? Кейт отвечает: Yes, I do."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Kate likes onions.","answer":"false","explanation":"Кейт говорит: I don't like onions."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Tom is a doctor.","answer":"not_given","explanation":"Профессия Бена в диалоге не названа."}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e02","hint":"Вопрос к Кейт.","explanation":"Do you want some food? — «Вы хотите что-нибудь поесть?»","difficulty":1,"words":["food","like","want"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"Do you want some food?","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["Do you want some food?","Do you like some food?","Does she want some food?"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e03","hint":"Четыре слова.","explanation":"Here is the menu — «вот меню».","difficulty":1,"words":["menu"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"Here is the menu.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e04","hint":"Четыре слова.","explanation":"I don't like onions — «я не люблю лук».","difficulty":1,"words":["onion","like"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"I don't like onions.","answers":["I do not like onions."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e05","hint":"Слово «с».","explanation":"A sandwich with cheese. With — «с».","difficulty":1,"words":["sandwich","want","with","for"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Kate wants a sandwich ___ cheese.","translation":"Кейт хочет бутерброд с сыром.","answers":[["with"]],"options":["with","for","at"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e06","hint":"Вопрос к одному человеку.","explanation":"Do you like tomatoes? С you — do.","difficulty":1,"words":["tomato","like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"___ you like tomatoes? — Yes, I do.","translation":"Вы любите помидоры? — Да.","answers":[["Do"]],"options":["Do","Does","Are"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e07","hint":"Три слова и один артикль.","explanation":"Here is the menu. Меню одно — is.","difficulty":1,"words":["menu"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Вот меню.","answer":"Here is the menu.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["are","a"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e08","hint":"С сыром — with cheese.","explanation":"I want a sandwich with cheese. Sandwich — считаемое слово, поэтому a.","difficulty":2,"words":["sandwich","want","with"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Я хочу бутерброд с сыром.","answers":["I want a sandwich with cheese."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e09","hint":"Yes, I… или No, I…","explanation":"Короткий ответ: Yes, I do. или No, I don't.","difficulty":3,"words":["onion","like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"Do you like onions?","questionRu":"Вы любите лук? Ответьте: Yes, I do. или No, I don't.","keywords":[["\\b(yes|no)\\b"],["\\bI (do|don't|do not)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["Yes, I do.","No, I don't."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e11","hint":"Он приносит еду гостям.","explanation":"The waiter works in a restaurant. Waiter — «официант».","difficulty":1,"words":["restaurant","waiter"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"The ___ works in a restaurant.","translation":"Официант работает в ресторане.","answers":[["waiter"]],"options":["waiter","teacher","doctor"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e12","hint":"Там обедают и ужинают.","explanation":"Restaurant [ˈrestrɑːnt] — «ресторан». Kitchen — «кухня».","difficulty":1,"words":["restaurant"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"ресторан","options":["restaurant","kitchen","school"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l06.e10","hint":"Вежливо и спокойно.","explanation":"Thank you [θæŋk juː]: начните со звука [θ] — язык между зубами.","difficulty":1,"words":["coffee","can-i-have"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"Thank you. Can I have a coffee, please?"}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l07","kind":"writing","title":"Моя еда","textId":"a1.u06.elena-food","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u06.l07.e01","hint":"Сравните, что любят Елена и Иван.","explanation":"Елена любит фрукты, овощи, рыбу и сыр и не ест мясо. Её брат Иван не любит овощи, зато любит пиццу, курицу и рис.","difficulty":1,"words":["bread","butter","meat","soup","salad","sugar","coffee","tea","juice","pizza","eat","like","with"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"comprehension","mode":"reading","textId":"a1.u06.elena-food","questions":[{"kind":"mcq","question":"Что Елена ест утром?","options":["bread with butter","soup and salad","pizza"],"answer":0,"explanation":"В тексте: In the morning she has bread with butter."},{"kind":"mcq","question":"Что Иван пьёт?","options":["coffee with sugar","tea with lemon","juice"],"answer":0,"explanation":"В тексте: He drinks coffee with sugar."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Elena eats meat.","answer":"false","explanation":"В тексте: She doesn't eat meat."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Ivan likes pizza.","answer":"true","explanation":"В тексте: He likes pizza, chicken and rice."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Elena likes tea with lemon.","answer":"not_given","explanation":"Про лимон в чае текст не говорит."}]},{"id":"a1.u06.l07.e02","hint":"Doesn't — отрицание.","explanation":"He doesn't like vegetables — «он не любит овощи».","difficulty":1,"words":["vegetable","like"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"He doesn't like vegetables.","options":["Он не любит овощи.","Он не ест овощи.","Ему нужны овощи."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.l07.e03","hint":"Речь о Елене.","explanation":"Elena likes fruit and vegetables. О другой женщине — likes.","difficulty":1,"words":["fruit","vegetable","like"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Elena ___ fruit and vegetables.","translation":"Елена любит фрукты и овощи.","answers":[["likes"]],"options":["likes","like","is like"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l07.e04","hint":"О мужчине — отрицание.","explanation":"Ivan doesn't eat vegetables. С he, she, it — doesn't.","difficulty":1,"words":["vegetable","eat"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Ivan ___ eat vegetables.","translation":"Иван не ест овощи.","answers":[["doesn't","does not"]],"options":["doesn't","don't","isn't"]},{"id":"a1.u06.l07.e05","hint":"На обед — for lunch.","explanation":"For lunch she eats soup and salad. С she — eats.","difficulty":3,"words":["soup","salad","eat","for"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"На обед она ест суп и салат.","answers":["For lunch she eats soup and salad.","She eats soup and salad for lunch."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l07.e06","hint":"Образец: I like… I don't like…","explanation":"Начните с I like…, потом добавьте I don't like…","difficulty":3,"words":["soup","onion","pizza","like"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_describe","picture":{"emoji":"🍽️"},"situation":"Расскажите, что вы любите есть и пить, а что не любите.","keywords":[["\\bI (like|don't like|do not like|eat|drink|want)\\b"],["\\b(soup|salad|pizza|chicken|rice|fish|meat|bread|cheese|sandwich|potato|potatoes|vegetables|fruit|tea|coffee|juice|water|milk)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["I like pizza and soup. I don't like onions."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l07.e07","hint":"I eat… или I have…","explanation":"Отвечаем полным предложением: I have bread with butter.","difficulty":3,"words":["bread","butter","coffee","tea","eat","drink","with","for"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"What do you eat for breakfast?","questionRu":"Что вы едите на завтрак? Ответьте: I eat… или I have…","keywords":[["\\bI (eat|have|drink)\\b"],["\\b(bread|butter|egg|eggs|cheese|fruit|tea|coffee|juice|milk|sandwich|rice|salad|soup)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["I have bread with butter and tea.","I eat eggs and drink coffee."]},{"id":"a1.u06.l07.e08","hint":"План: что люблю → чего не люблю → завтрак, обед, ужин.","explanation":"Рассказывая о еде, используйте I like… и I don't like…. О другом человеке — likes и doesn't like. Перед несчитаемыми словами ставьте some, но не a.","difficulty":3,"words":["bread","butter","rice","meat","chicken","soup","salad","potato","onion","coffee","tea","pizza","fruit","vegetable","eat","drink","like","want","with","for"],"grammar":["a1.like-want","a1.some-any","a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"write","task":"Напишите о своей еде: что вы любите и не любите, что едите на завтрак, обед и ужин. Например: I like soup. I don't like onions. For breakfast I have bread with butter.","minWords":30,"maxWords":90,"criteria":[{"id":"like","label":"Есть like или don't like","patterns":["\\b(like|likes|don't like|do not like|doesn't like|does not like)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"food","label":"Названа еда или напитки","patterns":["\\b(bread|butter|rice|meat|chicken|soup|salad|potato|potatoes|tomato|tomatoes|carrot|onion|onions|coffee|tea|juice|sandwich|pizza|fruit|vegetables|fish|cheese|egg|eggs|milk|water|cake)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"meals","label":"Есть завтрак, обед или ужин","patterns":["\\b(breakfast|lunch|dinner)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"some","label":"Есть some, any или with","patterns":["\\b(some|any|with)\\b"],"required":true}],"commonErrors":[{"pattern":"\\b(he|she) (like|eat|drink|want|have)\\b","message":"С he и she глагол получает -s: he likes, she eats."},{"pattern":"\\b(I|we|you|they) (likes|eats|drinks|wants|has)\\b","message":"С I, we, you, they глагол без -s: I like, we eat."},{"pattern":"\\bI am like\\b","message":"Like — глагол, be не нужен: I like pizza."},{"pattern":"\\bwant (eat|drink|have|cook)\\b","message":"Между want и глаголом нужно to: want to eat."},{"pattern":"\\b(a|an) (bread|rice|butter|meat|sugar|salt|milk|fruit|food)\\b","message":"Несчитаемые слова не употребляют с a или an: some bread, а не a bread."}],"samples":["I like soup and salad. I don't like onions. For breakfast I have bread with butter and drink tea. For lunch I eat chicken with rice. In the evening I want some fruit.","My brother likes pizza. He doesn't like vegetables. For dinner he eats meat with potatoes. I like fish and vegetables. I don't eat meat. I drink some water and coffee."]}]}],"test":{"passScore":0.8,"exercises":[{"id":"a1.u06.test.e01","hint":"Juice — напиток.","explanation":"Bread — хлеб, rice — рис, carrot — морковь, juice — сок, sugar — сахар.","difficulty":1,"words":["bread","rice","carrot","sugar","juice"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"bread","ru":"хлеб"},{"en":"rice","ru":"рис"},{"en":"carrot","ru":"морковь"},{"en":"juice","ru":"сок"},{"en":"sugar","ru":"сахар"}]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e02","hint":"Так говорят о хорошем блюде.","explanation":"Tasty — «вкусный», sweet — «сладкий», cold — «холодный».","difficulty":1,"words":["cold","sweet","tasty"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"вкусный","options":["tasty","sweet","cold"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e03","hint":"Его кладут между двумя кусками хлеба.","explanation":"Sandwich — «бутерброд»: [ˈsænwɪtʃ].","difficulty":1,"words":["sandwich"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"sandwich","distractors":["salad","pizza"]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e04","hint":"Утверждение.","explanation":"Правильно: I have some bread.","difficulty":1,"words":["bread"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I have ___ bread.","translation":"У меня есть хлеб.","answers":[["some"]],"options":["some","any","a"]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e05","hint":"Отрицание.","explanation":"Правильно: We don't have any rice.","difficulty":1,"words":["rice"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"We don't have ___ rice.","translation":"У нас нет риса.","answers":[["any"]],"options":["any","some","an"]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e06","hint":"Речь о другом человеке.","explanation":"Правильно: Does she like fish?","difficulty":1,"words":["like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"___ she like fish?","translation":"Она любит рыбу?","answers":[["Does"]],"options":["Does","Do","Is"]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e07","hint":"Короткий отрицательный ответ.","explanation":"Правильно: No, I don't.","difficulty":1,"words":["soup","want"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Do you want some soup? — No, I ___.","translation":"Вы хотите суп? — Нет.","answers":[["don't","do not"]],"options":["don't","doesn't","isn't"]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e08","hint":"Короткое слово перед глаголом.","explanation":"Правильно: I want to drink some water.","difficulty":1,"words":["drink","want","with","for"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I want ___ drink some water.","translation":"Я хочу пить воду.","answers":[["to"]],"options":["to","for","with"]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e09","hint":"С he — окончание.","explanation":"Правильно: He likes pizza.","difficulty":1,"words":["pizza","like"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"He like pizza.","wrong":"like","correction":"likes","options":["likes","liking","is like"]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e10","hint":"Рис нельзя посчитать.","explanation":"Правильно: I have some rice.","difficulty":1,"words":["rice"],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":["articles"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I have a rice.","wrong":"a rice","correction":"some rice","options":["some rice","an rice","any rice"]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e11","hint":"-s уже в does.","explanation":"Правильно: Does he like coffee?","difficulty":1,"words":["coffee","like"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"Does he likes coffee?","wrong":"likes","correction":"like","options":["like","liking","is like"]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e12","hint":"Это просьба.","explanation":"Can I have a coffee, please? — «Можно мне кофе, пожалуйста?»","difficulty":1,"words":["coffee","like","want","can-i-have"],"grammar":["a1.like-want"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"Can I have a coffee, please?","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["Can I have a coffee, please?","Do you want a coffee?","I like coffee."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e13","hint":"Четыре слова.","explanation":"She doesn't eat meat — «она не ест мясо».","difficulty":1,"words":["meat","eat"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"She doesn't eat meat.","answers":["She does not eat meat."]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e14","hint":"Образец: Do + you + like.","explanation":"Правильно: Do you like tea with sugar?","difficulty":2,"words":["sugar","tea","like","with"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple-questions"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Вы любите чай с сахаром?","answer":"Do you like tea with sugar?","alternatives":[],"distractors":["Does","any"]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e15","hint":"Образец: Don't + have.","explanation":"Правильно: I don't have any milk.","difficulty":2,"words":[],"grammar":["a1.some-any"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"У меня нет молока.","answers":["I don't have any milk.","I do not have any milk."]},{"id":"a1.u06.test.e16","hint":"Три коротких части.","explanation":"Правильно: For lunch — I eat — soup and salad.","difficulty":1,"words":["soup","salad","eat","for"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"For lunch I eat soup and salad."}]},"wordIds":["food","bread","butter","rice","meat","chicken","soup","salad","potato","tomato","carrot","onion","sugar","salt","coffee","tea","juice","sandwich","pizza","fruit","vegetable","menu","restaurant","waiter","hungry","thirsty","cold","sweet","tasty","eat","drink","like","want","some","any","with","for","can-i-have"]}
